    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061107.0162\n\nHONG KONG, Nov. 7 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nGold price lower in Hong Kong -- Nov. 7\n\n\n\n\nThe gold price in Hong Kong went down 7 HK dollars to 5,764 HK dollars per tael on Tuesday, according to Bank of China (Hong Kong).\n\nThe price is equivalent to 622.02 U.S. dollars a troy ounce, down 1.20 U.S. dollars at Tuesday's exchange rate of one U.S. dollar against 7.7785 HK dollars.",
